msgid "Politique de Confidentialite - Farm Control"
msgstr "Privacy Policy - Farm Control"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:7 app/templates/core/terms.html:7
msgid "Derniere mise a jour : 20 septembre 2026"
msgstr "Last updated: September 20, 2026"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:9
msgid "Cette page explique quelles donnees Farm Control collecte, pourquoi, et comment elles sont protegees."
msgstr "This page explains what data Farm Control collects, why, and how it is protected."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:11
msgid "1. Donnees collectees"
msgstr "1. Data collected"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:13
msgid "A l'inscription :"
msgstr "At sign-up:"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:13
msgid "nom, prenom, adresse email, mot de passe (jamais stocke en clair - voir securite ci-dessous), nom de l'exploitation, pays."
msgstr "first name, last name, email address, password (never stored in plain text - see security below), farm name, country."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:14
msgid "Donnees d'elevage :"
msgstr "Farming data:"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:14
msgid "tout ce que vous saisissez pour gerer vos fermes et lots (effectifs, consommation, mortalite, stock, fournisseurs, ventes, prix)."
msgstr "everything you enter to manage your farms and batches (headcounts, consumption, mortality, stock, suppliers, sales, prices)."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:15
msgid "Photos :"
msgstr "Photos:"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:15
msgid "si vous joignez une photo a une observation, elle est stockee pour illustrer cette observation."
msgstr "if you attach a photo to an observation, it is stored to illustrate that observation."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:16
msgid "Donnees techniques :"
msgstr "Technical data:"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:16
msgid "adresse IP et horodatage des connexions (pour la securite, notamment le verrouillage de compte apres des tentatives de connexion echouees), langue preferee."
msgstr "IP address and connection timestamps (for security, notably locking the account after failed login attempts), preferred language."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:18
msgid "Nous ne collectons jamais de donnees dont nous n'avons pas besoin pour faire fonctionner le service : pas de suivi publicitaire, pas de revente de donnees a des tiers."
msgstr "We never collect data we do not need to run the service: no advertising tracking, no resale of data to third parties."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:20
msgid "2. Pourquoi ces donnees"
msgstr "2. Why this data"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:21
msgid "Ces informations servent uniquement a fournir le service : faire fonctionner votre espace de gestion, vous envoyer les emails necessaires (confirmation de compte, alertes que vous avez activees, factures), et assurer la securite de votre compte."
msgstr "This information is used only to provide the service: run your management workspace, send you the emails that are needed (account confirmation, alerts you have enabled, invoices), and keep your account secure."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:23
msgid "3. Qui a acces a vos donnees"
msgstr "3. Who has access to your data"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:24
msgid "Vos donnees sont strictement isolees de celles des autres clients de Farm Control (isolation technique a deux niveaux, y compris au niveau de la base de donnees). Au sein de votre exploitation, l'acces depend du role de chaque utilisateur (proprietaire, responsable, travailleur) - voir la"
msgstr "Your data is strictly isolated from that of other Farm Control customers (two-level technical isolation, including at the database level). Within your farm, access depends on each user's role (owner, manager, worker) - see the"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:25
msgid "pour le detail des permissions."
msgstr "for details on permissions."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:26
msgid "Nous faisons appel a des prestataires techniques pour faire fonctionner le service, qui traitent vos donnees uniquement pour cet usage :"
msgstr "We use technical providers to run the service, who process your data only for that purpose:"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:28
msgid "Hebergement du site et de la base de donnees"
msgstr "Hosting of the site and the database"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:28
msgid "(infrastructure cloud)."
msgstr "(cloud infrastructure)."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:29
msgid "Envoi des emails transactionnels"
msgstr "Sending of transactional emails"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:29
msgid "(confirmation de compte, reinitialisation de mot de passe, alertes)."
msgstr "(account confirmation, password reset, alerts)."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:30
msgid "Traitement des paiements"
msgstr "Payment processing"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:30
msgid "pour les formules payantes (numero de telephone mobile money traite directement par ce prestataire, jamais stocke par Farm Control)."
msgstr "for paid plans (mobile money phone number is handled directly by this provider and never stored by Farm Control)."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:33
msgid "4. Securite"
msgstr "4. Security"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:34
msgid "Les mots de passe sont chiffres (jamais stockes en clair), les connexions au site sont chiffrees (HTTPS), et un compte est temporairement verrouille apres plusieurs echecs de connexion consecutifs. Les donnees de chaque exploitation sont isolees de celles des autres, y compris directement au niveau de la base de donnees (Row Level Security)."
msgstr "Passwords are encrypted (never stored in plain text), connections to the site are encrypted (HTTPS), and an account is temporarily locked after several consecutive failed login attempts. Each farm's data is isolated from the others', including directly at the database level (Row Level Security)."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:36
msgid "5. Conservation des donnees"
msgstr "5. Data retention"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:37
msgid "Vos donnees sont conservees tant que votre compte est actif. Si vous souhaitez la suppression complete de votre compte et de vos donnees, contactez-nous a l'adresse ci-dessous."
msgstr "Your data is kept as long as your account is active. If you want your account and data to be deleted completely, contact us at the address below."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:39
msgid "6. Vos droits"
msgstr "6. Your rights"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:41
msgid "Acces et export :"
msgstr "Access and export:"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:41
msgid "vous pouvez exporter l'integralite des donnees de votre exploitation a tout moment depuis les Parametres."
msgstr "you can export all your farm's data at any time from Settings."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:42
msgid "Correction :"
msgstr "Correction:"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:42
msgid "vous pouvez corriger vos informations de profil et la plupart de vos saisies directement dans l'application."
msgstr "you can correct your profile information and most of your entries directly in the application."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:43
msgid "Suppression :"
msgstr "Deletion:"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:43
msgid "sur simple demande par email, vos donnees personnelles et celles de votre exploitation seront supprimees, sauf obligation legale de conservation (ex : historique de facturation)."
msgstr "on simple request by email, your personal data and your farm's data will be deleted, unless there is a legal retention obligation (e.g. billing history)."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:46
msgid "7. Cookies"
msgstr "7. Cookies"

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:47
msgid "Farm Control utilise uniquement un cookie de session necessaire pour rester connecte, et un cookie de preference de langue. Aucun cookie publicitaire ou de suivi tiers n'est utilise."
msgstr "Farm Control only uses a session cookie needed to stay logged in, and a language preference cookie. No advertising or third-party tracking cookies are used."

#: app/templates/core/privacy.html:49
msgid "8. Contact"
msgstr "8. Contact"

